%% Workflow across actors: supplier invoice from photo to paid.
%% In Mermaid, use a sequenceDiagram for swimlanes: each participant is a lane, time runs downward.
%% (flowchart subgraphs lose their lane direction as soon as arrows cross lanes, so they tangle.)
%% For a true box-and-arrow swimlane, draw it on the ArchaDev canvas: examples/canvas-flows.js.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Pemilik toko
  participant A as Arunika
  actor K as Admin keuangan
  P->>A: Foto nota supplier
  A->>A: Baca nota (OCR), cocokkan dengan stok masuk
  A->>P: Tagihan + jatuh tempo, minta persetujuan
  alt disetujui
    P->>K: Teruskan untuk dibayar
    K->>K: Bayar lewat m-banking
    A-->>A: Tandai lunas saat mutasi masuk
  else ditolak
    P->>A: Foto ulang / koreksi
  end
  Note over A: Langkah Arunika otomatis, yang lain manual
